WEBVTT

00:02.340 --> 00:03.170
<b>MewType</b>

00:09.010 --> 00:10.140
<b>What is this?</b>

00:10.260 --> 00:11.220
<b>MewType?</b>

00:11.760 --> 00:13.220
<b>Member-stealing band</b>

00:13.350 --> 00:15.220
<b>I'm a Fairy Bouquet fan</b>

00:15.520 --> 00:17.430
<b>Give Clematis back</b>

00:17.560 --> 00:20.020
<b>Oh, so this is Erea's band?</b>

00:20.150 --> 00:21.610
<b>I'm excited</b>

00:22.610 --> 00:23.570
<b>Dislike</b>

00:23.690 --> 00:24.980
<b>Stop, stop!</b>

00:25.610 --> 00:26.780
<b>You have some nerve</b>

00:26.900 --> 00:28.110
<b>Is this real?</b>

00:29.450 --> 00:30.820
<b>It's over for them</b>

00:30.990 --> 00:32.370
<b><i>Step right up, come on</i></b>

00:32.530 --> 00:34.200
<b><i>The showtime's starting</i></b>

00:34.370 --> 00:35.450
<b><i>No one can look away</i></b>

00:35.620 --> 00:37.290
<b><i>No need to hold back</i></b>

00:37.620 --> 00:39.120
<b><i>No tricks, no gimmicks</i></b>

00:39.290 --> 00:40.830
<b><i>That's who we are, MewType</i></b>

00:41.000 --> 00:42.750
<b><i>Take a bite, have it all</i></b>

00:43.500 --> 00:46.550
<b><i>Where did our stolen melody go?</i></b>

00:46.710 --> 00:50.300
<b><i>Justice tangled in knots
You lure us, then take it all</i></b>

00:50.430 --> 00:53.140
<b><i>What's so fun in all those lies?</i></b>

00:53.260 --> 00:56.680
<b><i>I see right through you,
your scheme laid bare</i></b>

00:57.390 --> 01:00.440
<b><i>Just an icon howling loud in a fantasy</i></b>

01:00.560 --> 01:03.190
<b><i>Show your face,
love and hate, no shroud</i></b>

01:03.400 --> 01:05.940
<b><i>Slapping on labels...
Saying I'm not enough...</i></b>

01:06.110 --> 01:09.740
<b><i>Even those who stand by share the blame</i></b>

01:11.610 --> 01:16.330
<b><i>Loud and proud, we declare war
No outsiders anymore</i></b>

01:16.580 --> 01:19.500
<b><i>So bite your tongue, keep it down</i></b>

01:19.620 --> 01:22.580
<b><i>I don't need an age that's never known love</i></b>

01:22.710 --> 01:25.500
<b><i>Let my heart ignite, NewType</i></b>

01:26.090 --> 01:29.170
<b><i>Q. No drive at all, what's your move?</i></b>

01:29.300 --> 01:32.010
<b><i>A. I'll beg for forgiveness, even for my sins</i></b>

01:32.380 --> 01:35.390
<b><i>The times depend</i></b>

01:35.550 --> 01:37.560
<b><i>On where we focus</i></b>

01:50.530 --> 01:53.070
<b><i>Never again, stay out of my life</i></b>

01:53.240 --> 01:56.330
<b><i>I'll pay the price for what I've done</i></b>

01:56.660 --> 01:59.660
<b><i>Even if loneliness leads</i></b>

01:59.910 --> 02:03.830
<b><i>To the edge of despair</i></b>

02:05.000 --> 02:07.920
<b><i>I don't need an age that's never known love</i></b>

02:11.550 --> 02:14.590
<b><i>I want to learn love and live in this moment</i></b>

02:19.770 --> 02:24.140
<b><i>Loud and proud, we declare war
No outsiders anymore</i></b>

02:24.650 --> 02:27.310
<b><i>So bite your tongue, keep it down...</i></b>

02:27.690 --> 02:30.650
<b><i>I want to learn love and live in this moment</i></b>

02:30.780 --> 02:34.150
<b><i>Let my heart ignite, NewType</i></b>

02:34.320 --> 02:37.280
<b><i>Q. No drive at all, what's your move?</i></b>

02:37.410 --> 02:40.370
<b><i>A. I'll beg for forgiveness, even for my sins</i></b>

02:40.540 --> 02:43.460
<b><i>The times depend</i></b>

02:43.580 --> 02:45.920
<b><i>On where we focus</i></b>

02:46.920 --> 02:49.880
<b><i>The times depend</i></b>

02:50.050 --> 02:52.710
<b><i>On where we focus</i></b>

03:05.440 --> 03:06.520
<b><i>There it is again</i></b>

03:06.650 --> 03:10.070
<b><i>That plastered-on smile
Those empty words</i></b>

03:10.190 --> 03:12.070
<b><i>Perfect pose, right?</i></b>

03:12.190 --> 03:14.740
<b><i>Hey, don't label me like that</i></b>

03:15.150 --> 03:19.320
<b><i>Shake shake shake this fragile heart
Geek geek geek geek so loud</i></b>

03:19.870 --> 03:23.910
<b><i>Ache ache it won't let go
Holding my shallow breath</i></b>

03:24.080 --> 03:26.000
<b><i>If we're living in yesterday</i></b>

03:26.160 --> 03:29.420
<b><i>I don't want to lose my breath again</i></b>

03:29.540 --> 03:33.880
<b><i>With every scar we carry
let's stand and fight</i></b>

03:34.010 --> 03:34.800
<b><i>You and I</i></b>

03:34.920 --> 03:37.260
<b><i>Stronger, stronger</i></b>

03:37.380 --> 03:39.590
<b><i>So nothing slips away</i></b>

03:39.720 --> 03:42.720
<b><i>Through every night,
we'll break the dark</i></b>

03:42.890 --> 03:44.560
<b><i>I'm not alone anymore</i></b>

03:44.720 --> 03:46.640
<b><i>That light and even this pain</i></b>

03:46.770 --> 03:49.060
<b><i>Is there for us to share</i></b>

03:49.190 --> 03:52.070
<b><i>With your words, I can look ahead</i></b>

03:52.230 --> 03:54.110
<b><i>I'm not alone anymore</i></b>

03:54.280 --> 03:58.280
<b><i>Our sound, our truth
it starts tonight</i></b>

03:58.410 --> 03:59.950
<b><i>Don't look away</i></b>

04:04.540 --> 04:08.750
<b><i>No more zipped lips
I'm done with silence</i></b>

04:08.920 --> 04:13.340
<b><i>Don't let them pull your strings
Don't dance to hollow voices</i></b>

04:14.000 --> 04:18.630
<b><i>Going with the flow
Is that how I want to be?</i></b>

04:18.970 --> 04:23.100
<b><i>Hey, eyes over here</i></b>

04:23.350 --> 04:27.980
<b><i>Tick tick tick time won't wait
Kick kick kick straight into tomorrow</i></b>

04:28.100 --> 04:32.440
<b><i>Heat heat this burning heart
we'll turn it into a song</i></b>

04:32.770 --> 04:37.360
<b><i>Shake shake shake this fragile heart
Geek geek geek that's me</i></b>

04:37.490 --> 04:42.070
<b><i>Ache ache I'll face it all
before it festers and swells</i></b>

04:42.240 --> 04:43.070
<b><i>You and I</i></b>

04:43.200 --> 04:45.450
<b><i>Stronger, stronger</i></b>

04:45.580 --> 04:47.870
<b><i>I won't let go of your hand</i></b>

04:48.000 --> 04:50.790
<b><i>Even if we're wrong,
with you I can stand</i></b>

04:50.960 --> 04:52.540
<b><i>I'm not alone anymore</i></b>

04:52.670 --> 04:54.880
<b><i>That memory and this fire inside</i></b>

04:55.000 --> 04:57.260
<b><i>Were always meant to guide us</i></b>

04:57.420 --> 05:00.260
<b><i>With your words I can move forward</i></b>

05:00.380 --> 05:02.050
<b><i>I'm not alone anymore</i></b>

05:06.890 --> 05:11.730
<b><i>Right here, with our hands together</i></b>

05:12.600 --> 05:14.900
<b><i>Stronger, stronger</i></b>

05:15.020 --> 05:17.280
<b><i>I won't be weak anymore</i></b>

05:17.400 --> 05:21.200
<b><i>With you, with your words
I'm moving forward</i></b>

05:22.530 --> 05:26.370
<b><i>Our voices, our truth
are echoing now</i></b>

05:26.490 --> 05:27.950
<b><i>Don't look away</i></b>

05:42.050 --> 05:43.840
<b>MewType
Arale Nakamachi (Vo.)</b>

05:43.970 --> 05:45.680
<b>Nonoka Miyanaga (Gt.)
Ritsu Minetsuki (Gt.)</b>

05:45.800 --> 05:47.430
<b>Miyako Fuji (Key.)
Yuno Sengoku (DJ & Mp.)</b>

05:52.310 --> 05:54.650
<b>We did it!</b>

05:54.770 --> 05:56.310
<b>Good work, everyone!</b>

05:56.650 --> 05:58.400
<b>Despite some difficulties,</b>

05:58.860 --> 06:00.940
<b>the show was absolutely amazing.</b>

06:01.110 --> 06:02.530
<b>Yay!</b>

06:02.650 --> 06:06.700
<b>The viewers were really into it,
and the numbers look great.</b>

06:07.910 --> 06:11.660
<b>Many were just trolling
because of the controversy,</b>

06:11.790 --> 06:14.080
<b>but some really appreciated it.</b>

06:14.370 --> 06:18.130
<b>We were pushed by
Nakamachi-san and Fuji-san's passion.</b>

06:18.250 --> 06:23.090
<b>Let's do our best so we can look back
and know it was the right call.</b>

06:23.220 --> 06:25.470
<b>Well, the show itself wasn't bad.</b>

06:25.590 --> 06:27.140
<b>Yuno-san-chan!</b>

06:27.260 --> 06:28.890
<b>Now that Minetsuki-san has joined,</b>

06:29.180 --> 06:32.600
<b>let's think of this band
as MewType Version 2.0.</b>

06:32.730 --> 06:34.770
<b>A fresh start from here on!</b>

06:34.940 --> 06:36.350
<b>Yes!</b>

06:36.480 --> 06:37.900
<b>That's it for today.</b>

06:38.320 --> 06:40.110
<b>Everyone, get some rest.</b>

06:40.230 --> 06:43.070
<b>Thank you.</b>

06:44.200 --> 06:46.740
<b>This is strange... I wonder why...</b>

06:46.870 --> 06:50.290
<b>For some reason,
I still want to be with you all.</b>

06:50.490 --> 06:51.790
<b>Me too.</b>

06:51.910 --> 06:53.910
<b>I had so much fun.</b>

06:54.210 --> 06:57.250
<b>The live show was so much fun!</b>

06:57.380 --> 07:00.300
<b>Yuno-san-chan put music to my lyrics,</b>

07:00.420 --> 07:02.630
<b>and it turned out insanely cool.</b>

07:03.920 --> 07:04.760
<b>Yeah?</b>

07:04.930 --> 07:07.390
<b>Everyone's performance was incredible!</b>

07:07.510 --> 07:10.010
<b>And I could sing with all my heart!</b>

07:10.140 --> 07:14.560
<b>Miyako-san, thank you
for suggesting the live show.</b>

07:14.680 --> 07:18.520
<b>It's nothing. I'm happy
we had this opportunity too.</b>

07:18.650 --> 07:21.730
<b>Did I really manage to shine today?</b>

07:21.860 --> 07:22.900
<b>Yako-sensei.</b>

07:23.030 --> 07:23.820
<b>And also!</b>

07:24.070 --> 07:27.950
<b>Ricchan's avatar really suits her,
doesn't it?!</b>

07:28.160 --> 07:31.410
<b>- Doppelganger.
- They made it so fast.</b>

07:32.330 --> 07:35.500
<b>It was a tough battle,
but we didn't slack off.</b>

07:35.620 --> 07:38.880
<b>I'm so happy we could all
stand on stage together.</b>

07:39.000 --> 07:40.670
<b>Right, Ricchan?</b>

07:41.750 --> 07:43.340
<b>Ricchan?</b>

07:45.470 --> 07:47.840
<b>I was kind of zoning out.</b>

07:48.180 --> 07:53.850
<b>Yes, it was really fun.
I haven't felt like this in a long time.</b>

07:55.060 --> 07:56.230
<b>Ricchan.</b>

07:56.390 --> 08:00.110
<b>Thanks to you all,
I got on stage with a positive attitude.</b>

08:00.230 --> 08:02.940
<b>I hope we can keep
going strong together.</b>

08:03.570 --> 08:04.780
<b>Ricchan.</b>

08:05.690 --> 08:07.200
<b>She's shining.</b>

08:07.900 --> 08:09.820
<b>Let's go out and celebrate.</b>

08:09.950 --> 08:11.410
<b>No, I'm good.</b>

08:11.530 --> 08:13.370
<b>What does a robot eat?</b>

08:13.490 --> 08:15.910
<b>- I'm not a...
- Ricchan, what do you want?</b>

08:16.120 --> 08:17.120
<b>Ten pounds!</b>

08:17.500 --> 08:18.960
<b>Medium well!</b>

08:19.080 --> 08:22.500
<b>I'll take five pounds with garlic sauce,</b>

08:22.630 --> 08:27.880
<b>and the rest with
Japanese-style Chaliapin sauce!</b>

08:28.590 --> 08:30.180
<b>Sugar pearls...</b>

08:38.940 --> 08:43.940
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

08:44.650 --> 08:48.900
<b><i>The story always revolves around us</i></b>

08:49.360 --> 08:53.990
<b><i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i></b>

08:54.410 --> 08:59.330
<b><i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i></b>

08:59.540 --> 09:04.210
<b><i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i></b>

09:04.460 --> 09:08.420
<b><i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i></b>

09:08.550 --> 09:15.060
<b><i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i></b>

09:15.310 --> 09:19.930
<b><i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i></b>

09:20.230 --> 09:24.730
<b><i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i></b>

09:24.900 --> 09:28.740
<b><i>This is the plot of our survival</i></b>

09:29.150 --> 09:34.490
<b><i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i></b>

09:34.620 --> 09:39.160
<b><i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i></b>

09:39.410 --> 09:43.710
<b><i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i></b>

09:43.830 --> 09:47.090
<b><i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i></b>

09:47.210 --> 09:50.470
<b><i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i></b>

09:50.630 --> 09:53.800
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i></b>

09:53.930 --> 09:55.300
<b><i>Following the steady beat</i></b>

09:55.470 --> 10:00.480
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

10:03.850 --> 10:04.850
<b>Good morning!</b>

10:05.270 --> 10:06.940
<b>Good morning.</b>

10:08.820 --> 10:12.900
<b>So, uh... well...</b>

10:13.240 --> 10:16.070
<b>How was your day yesterday?</b>

10:16.200 --> 10:19.910
<b>Like, around 6 PM,
were you doing anything?</b>

10:20.330 --> 10:22.160
<b>Oh, we saw your live show.</b>

10:22.290 --> 10:23.620
<b>It was so amazing.</b>

10:25.170 --> 10:26.210
<b>I know, right?</b>

10:26.330 --> 10:29.420
<b>Ricchan, Nono-chan-san,
Yuno-san-chan, and Miyako-san...</b>

10:29.550 --> 10:31.210
<b>They were amazing, right?</b>

10:31.340 --> 10:32.760
<b>You too, Arale-chan.</b>

10:32.880 --> 10:36.590
<b>- Yeah, you sang so well.
- I was shouting at the screen.</b>

10:38.350 --> 10:40.220
<b>- That book.
- Huh?</b>

10:40.560 --> 10:43.810
<b>Oh, it's the first volume
of "Chupacabu Saturation."</b>

10:43.980 --> 10:45.270
<b>I forgot</b>

10:47.560 --> 10:49.860
<b>T... the show took over my mind.</b>

10:49.980 --> 10:51.480
<b>You reserved it, right?</b>

10:51.610 --> 10:53.240
<b>Of course, I had to!</b>

10:53.360 --> 10:57.570
<b>But I'm a terrible fan
for not getting it on the release day.</b>

10:57.700 --> 11:01.790
<b>Judging by that,
I bet you forgot about today's quiz too.</b>

11:03.910 --> 11:04.910
<b>"How lovely..."</b>

11:05.670 --> 11:07.540
<b>She looks cheerful.</b>

11:07.670 --> 11:09.920
<b>Maybe she doesn't know?</b>

11:12.260 --> 11:15.260
<b>I guess that wouldn't be surprising.</b>

11:14.470 --> 11:15.880
<b>Animal Encyclopedia</b>

11:16.050 --> 11:18.390
<b>11. MewType</b>

11:16.630 --> 11:18.390
<b>MewType's doing great.</b>

11:18.600 --> 11:19.760
<b>They're still trending.</b>

11:19.890 --> 11:22.100
<b>Well, their show was incredible.</b>

11:22.680 --> 11:23.930
<b>So beautiful.</b>

11:25.060 --> 11:27.980
<b>I can't believe you can shine like this.</b>

11:28.400 --> 11:32.320
<b>It makes me want you even more.</b>

11:32.570 --> 11:33.690
<b>Who?</b>

11:33.820 --> 11:37.070
<b>Someone who deserves a little reward.</b>

11:37.610 --> 11:38.490
<b>What's this?</b>

11:38.660 --> 11:41.490
<b>Thank you for your support!</b>

11:38.660 --> 11:39.780
<b>A manga?</b>

11:43.870 --> 11:45.830
<b>Yako-sensei.</b>

11:48.960 --> 11:52.300
<b>My life is so fun.</b>

11:52.420 --> 11:56.470
<b>I reserved two copies,
one to keep and one to read.</b>

11:54.460 --> 11:59.180
<b>Chupacabu Saturation</b>

11:56.590 --> 11:59.180
<b>That was totally a good move!</b>

12:00.090 --> 12:03.350
<b>All right.
I'll visit the bookstores next.</b>

12:05.100 --> 12:07.390
<b>Ricchan?</b>

12:07.560 --> 12:09.190
<b>- Isn't that Clematis?
- Who?</b>

12:09.310 --> 12:12.940
<b>You don't know? She's bad news.
She blew off the event.</b>

12:13.230 --> 12:14.690
<b>11. MewType</b>

12:15.940 --> 12:17.570
<b>Ricchan!</b>

12:22.240 --> 12:23.530
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

12:24.450 --> 12:27.330
<b>- You did great on our first live!
- You too.</b>

12:30.830 --> 12:32.460
<b>My body is so sore!</b>

12:32.590 --> 12:34.550
<b>I hope we can all meet up soon.</b>

12:34.920 --> 12:38.300
<b>Yeah, I want to meet Yuno-san-chan too.</b>

12:38.420 --> 12:39.680
<b>You've never met her?</b>

12:39.800 --> 12:41.260
<b>You have, right?</b>

12:41.390 --> 12:44.060
<b>How is she as a robot?</b>

12:46.560 --> 12:48.430
<b>She has nice graphics.</b>

12:48.560 --> 12:50.730
<b>Graphics, huh?</b>

12:52.230 --> 12:55.190
<b>I still feel like I'm dreaming.</b>

12:55.730 --> 13:00.150
<b>I can't believe I got to sing
to your guitar again.</b>

13:02.570 --> 13:06.410
<b>Are you all right?
With what people are saying online...</b>

13:06.580 --> 13:08.540
<b>Dreams are power!</b>

13:09.500 --> 13:13.080
<b>Dreams are amazing.
They really give you power.</b>

13:13.210 --> 13:18.090
<b>It was my dream to perform live,
and I finally did it.</b>

13:18.210 --> 13:19.050
<b>So, you know what?</b>

13:19.550 --> 13:23.140
<b>I'll cherish your dream too,
no matter what!</b>

13:25.510 --> 13:28.520
<b>Yeah. Dreams are power.</b>

13:30.270 --> 13:32.730
<b>I can't just keep being protected.</b>

13:33.940 --> 13:37.730
<b>This time,
I've decided to protect Arale-chan.</b>

13:39.820 --> 13:42.780
<b>And for that, I'll do whatever I can.</b>

13:44.740 --> 13:48.580
<b>Please find attached
the manuscript for chapter 18.</b>

13:48.700 --> 13:53.540
<b>Please kindly review it. Thank you.</b>

13:53.710 --> 13:57.050
<b>All right! See that?
Two days in advance!</b>

13:57.170 --> 13:59.840
<b>This is Yako Fujimi at her best!</b>

14:00.010 --> 14:03.220
<b>Body and soul feel great,
food is delicious!</b>

14:00.010 --> 14:02.800
<b>Now my daily post after work!</b>

14:03.720 --> 14:06.970
<b>What is this?
I'm so motivated, I can't stop.</b>

14:07.100 --> 14:11.020
<b>If anything, it just keeps bubbling up.</b>

14:11.350 --> 14:12.310
<b>That...</b>

14:13.350 --> 14:14.600
<b>And this...</b>

14:15.610 --> 14:17.070
<b>Is all...</b>

14:21.940 --> 14:26.160
<b>Oh no, no. I guess I'll go browse
the comments on my new volume.</b>

14:26.280 --> 14:30.910
<b>I worked hard on the bonus stuff,
so I hope everyone's enjoying it.</b>

14:32.080 --> 14:34.580
<b>"MewType's live show"?</b>

14:35.290 --> 14:38.170
<b>So I really was able to shine.</b>

14:40.550 --> 14:44.590
<b>"I feel so bad for Fairy Bouquet."</b>

14:44.720 --> 14:47.300
<b>"I'm worried about Viola."</b>

14:47.430 --> 14:50.100
<b>"Get lost, Arale."</b>

14:50.220 --> 14:53.100
<b>"That avatar's definitely Clematis."</b>

14:54.100 --> 14:56.230
<b>"I never want to see them again."</b>

14:56.560 --> 14:58.480
<b>What is this?</b>

14:58.820 --> 15:02.030
<b>Was I not able to shine?</b>

15:09.280 --> 15:11.490
<b>"A show after stealing a member?"</b>

15:11.620 --> 15:13.040
<b>"They were so hyped."</b>

15:13.160 --> 15:14.290
<b>"Apologize first."</b>

15:14.410 --> 15:17.080
<b>"They're not even hiding Clematis."</b>

15:17.210 --> 15:18.420
<b>"Trolling expert."</b>

15:18.540 --> 15:19.840
<b>"Yuno's in MewType?"</b>

15:19.960 --> 15:21.000
<b>"She was fired up."</b>

15:21.250 --> 15:23.210
<b>"Fairy's fans should be mad."</b>

15:23.340 --> 15:24.420
<b>"Keep it fair."</b>

15:24.590 --> 15:25.800
<b>"They deleted posts."</b>

15:25.930 --> 15:28.550
<b>"The food post was deleted instantly."</b>

15:28.680 --> 15:29.930
<b>"This is crazy."</b>

15:30.100 --> 15:32.680
<b>"MewType's out of control."</b>

15:33.470 --> 15:34.480
<b>Good morning!</b>

15:35.180 --> 15:37.560
<b>- Good morning.
- Morning.</b>

15:40.650 --> 15:45.320
<b>Ta-da! Look!
I collected all the bonus stickers!</b>

15:46.400 --> 15:47.240
<b>Huh?</b>

15:47.610 --> 15:50.950
<b>Arale-chan, you don't have to
pretend to be cheerful.</b>

15:51.080 --> 15:54.040
<b>Yeah. I mean, that's a bit too much...</b>

15:54.540 --> 15:55.750
<b>Right?</b>

15:56.290 --> 15:59.130
<b>Wait, did you find out I lost the raffle</b>

15:59.250 --> 16:03.170
<b>for the Chupa-Satu volume release poster
signed by Yako-sensei?</b>

16:03.300 --> 16:04.960
<b>Sorry, that's not it.</b>

16:05.880 --> 16:08.050
<b>- Then, what are you...
- Excuse me.</b>

16:09.050 --> 16:12.640
<b>Do you have some time after school?</b>

16:14.640 --> 16:21.230
<b>I also have lots of stuff
I want to talk to you about!</b>

16:21.440 --> 16:23.270
<b>Seasonal Strawberry Parfait</b>

16:23.650 --> 16:27.950
<b>I'm not surprised you know
a spot with such great vibes.</b>

16:28.400 --> 16:30.110
<b>I don't know what to get.</b>

16:30.240 --> 16:35.830
<b>I asked for your time because
there are a few things I'd like to ask.</b>

16:38.960 --> 16:45.210
<b>Why is MewType facing so much backlash?</b>

16:46.010 --> 16:48.590
<b>We were shining on stage at the show,</b>

16:48.720 --> 16:51.470
<b>so why are we getting criticized?</b>

16:51.590 --> 16:55.930
<b>Welcoming a new member at a live show
should be wonderful, right?</b>

16:56.060 --> 16:59.600
<b>So how on earth did it turn into this?</b>

16:59.730 --> 17:02.060
<b>Arale, do you know what's going on?</b>

17:02.480 --> 17:06.860
<b>Even my daily posts are getting
all these strange replies.</b>

17:06.980 --> 17:07.780
<b>Well...</b>

17:08.070 --> 17:10.570
<b>Fairy Bouquet? Clematis?</b>

17:10.700 --> 17:12.780
<b>Just who is Viola?!</b>

17:13.200 --> 17:16.490
<b>You said MewType was receiving backlash?</b>

17:18.910 --> 17:21.670
<b>Chupacabu Saturation</b>

17:19.960 --> 17:21.670
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

17:22.290 --> 17:24.540
<b>I didn't realize you didn't know.</b>

17:25.040 --> 17:28.130
<b>I'm sorry you had to
hear about it like this.</b>

17:28.510 --> 17:29.630
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

17:29.760 --> 17:33.640
<b>With the show and Chupa-Satu,
I didn't touch my phone for a while.</b>

17:34.180 --> 17:37.310
<b>But hey, there are lots of
nice comments too.</b>

17:37.430 --> 17:38.220
<b>But...</b>

17:38.520 --> 17:40.230
<b>It must have confused you.</b>

17:40.350 --> 17:42.270
<b>Clematis is actually Ricchan.</b>

17:42.400 --> 17:45.440
<b>We used to perform together
in the same group,</b>

17:45.570 --> 17:48.360
<b>and Viola is...</b>

17:54.740 --> 17:55.580
<b>Let's go.</b>

17:55.990 --> 17:57.450
<b>Sorry, we'll be back.</b>

18:04.080 --> 18:05.500
<b>Hey.</b>

18:05.670 --> 18:07.750
<b>Wait, Arale-san.</b>

18:07.880 --> 18:09.550
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

18:14.340 --> 18:17.720
<b>I didn't expect you
to run off so suddenly.</b>

18:18.510 --> 18:20.310
<b>You two know each other?</b>

18:20.430 --> 18:21.890
<b>Give it back!</b>

18:24.560 --> 18:28.230
<b>You're a fan of Yako-sensei too.</b>

18:29.440 --> 18:31.030
<b>Just like me.</b>

18:32.360 --> 18:34.700
<b>Don't you dare! I'm done losing!</b>

18:34.990 --> 18:37.700
<b>I know all about
your lies and your schemes!</b>

18:37.990 --> 18:40.910
<b>You hurt Ricchan
the same way you hurt me.</b>

18:39.790 --> 18:40.910
<b>Arale-san?</b>

18:41.080 --> 18:43.580
<b>I understand everything now.</b>

18:43.870 --> 18:45.710
<b>I won't lose to you again.</b>

18:45.830 --> 18:49.590
<b>I don't even know what you mean
about losing or lying.</b>

18:49.710 --> 18:50.710
<b>Cut the act!</b>

18:51.760 --> 18:53.340
<b>No...</b>

18:54.050 --> 19:00.390
<b>I was honestly shocked about Clematis.</b>

19:03.310 --> 19:08.480
<b>But my feelings for you both
haven't changed.</b>

19:08.610 --> 19:11.190
<b>I really wanted to root for MewType.</b>

19:11.320 --> 19:15.990
<b>You manipulate people
with your lies and tear them apart.</b>

19:16.740 --> 19:19.200
<b>But this time, I won't let you.</b>

19:19.450 --> 19:21.660
<b>Now, I have the members of MewType</b>

19:21.790 --> 19:24.290
<b>and responsible adults who will help me.</b>

19:24.410 --> 19:26.040
<b>I'm not afraid of you.</b>

19:26.170 --> 19:27.880
<b>Please, wait.</b>

19:28.170 --> 19:29.880
<b>You've got it wrong.</b>

19:31.670 --> 19:32.670
<b>Yako-sensei.</b>

19:32.800 --> 19:36.630
<b>It was because of her that I decided
to do the live show.</b>

19:36.760 --> 19:40.760
<b>She made me realize there are things
you only learn by trying.</b>

19:42.430 --> 19:44.560
<b>- So, please...
- I see.</b>

19:44.680 --> 19:48.150
<b>You knew the show
would give us a bad look.</b>

19:48.270 --> 19:50.770
<b>So you used Miyako-san
as part of your plan.</b>

19:51.730 --> 19:53.150
<b>You won't get away with this.</b>

19:53.860 --> 19:55.820
<b>- I...
- Enough already!</b>

19:56.530 --> 19:59.490
<b>We're the ones who decided
to do the show.</b>

19:59.620 --> 20:02.030
<b>Blaming her for that is wrong.</b>

20:02.160 --> 20:04.040
<b>Wait, Miyako-san...</b>

20:07.370 --> 20:10.540
<b>No, stop! Don't let Viola fool you!</b>

20:10.670 --> 20:12.170
<b>I'm not being fooled!</b>

20:12.340 --> 20:16.800
<b>She truly understands me.
She's my greatest fan!</b>

20:18.050 --> 20:20.470
<b>She picked up on all the emotions</b>

20:20.590 --> 20:23.010
<b>I had poured into my work.</b>

20:23.310 --> 20:26.890
<b>No one has ever told me
they loved my work so much!</b>

20:32.400 --> 20:35.400
<b>Yako-sensei, it's all right.</b>

20:35.530 --> 20:38.740
<b>Just having you believe in me is enough.</b>

21:04.510 --> 21:07.600
<b>This is just too perfect.</b>

21:13.900 --> 21:17.070
<b>Magical Physical Kululu</b>

21:14.190 --> 21:17.070
<b>Why would Miyako-san say that?</b>

21:17.490 --> 21:21.280
<b>She acted like she knew Viola,
even though she doesn't.</b>

21:21.410 --> 21:24.160
<b>- Good morning, everyone.
- Good morning.</b>

21:24.410 --> 21:27.200
<b>We have a new transfer student today.</b>

21:27.330 --> 21:29.160
<b>- Come on in.
- Yes.</b>

21:30.960 --> 21:34.040
<b>Minetsuki-san,
please introduce yourself.</b>

21:34.500 --> 21:36.000
<b>"Minetsuki"?</b>

21:39.510 --> 21:42.340
<b>I transferred here
from Akiha Girls' Academy.</b>

21:42.470 --> 21:43.760
<b>I'm Ritsu Minetsuki.</b>

21:43.930 --> 21:45.510
<b>It's nice to meet you.</b>

21:46.180 --> 21:48.930
<b>- Ri... Ri... Ri...
- I'm sorry.</b>

21:49.100 --> 21:50.350
<b>Ricchan?!</b>

21:55.900 --> 22:03.660
<b><i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i></b>

22:03.780 --> 22:07.540
<b><i>How will you live today?</i></b>

22:07.660 --> 22:15.580
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

22:19.510 --> 22:27.260
<b><i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i></b>

22:27.390 --> 22:34.980
<b><i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i></b>

22:35.770 --> 22:43.070
<b><i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i></b>

22:43.700 --> 22:51.410
<b><i>Come with us
To uncover the wonders of the universe</i></b>

22:53.040 --> 23:00.710
<b><i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i></b>

23:00.840 --> 23:04.590
<b><i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i></b>

23:04.720 --> 23:11.810
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:12.600 --> 23:19.570
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:25.780 --> 23:28.160
<b>I'm hungry.</b>

23:28.280 --> 23:31.660
<b>Give me anything.
I need carbs, and I need them now.</b>

23:31.790 --> 23:34.160
<b>Oh, there's a ramen shop right here.</b>

23:34.290 --> 23:37.210
<b>Extra back fat shower? Perfect.</b>

23:37.330 --> 23:39.670
<b>Jackpot.</b>

23:38.380 --> 23:39.880
<b>Gold star</b>
